// IR pin: BUG-04-159 — a same-frame `catch(expr: 1 / 0)` makes @main
// may-unwind. The checked div-by-zero panic is emitted as `invoke
// @ori_panic_cstr` to a catch landing pad, so `_ori_main` MUST NOT be marked
// `nounwind` and MUST carry a `landingpad`. Pins the landing pad surviving to
// codegen (the exit-code cells cannot observe the nounwind attribute / IR shape).
@main () -> int = {
    let result = catch(expr: 1 / 0);
    if result.is_err() then 0 else 1
}
